sections.body:
Not specified. Open points for the owner, to settle with `adj ask` before this slice runs:
(a) the directory mode, if any, for the run directory and the per-round temp directories (0700 is a candidate, not a decision);
(b) whether ork tightens an existing run.json or run directory on load or only on the next save;
(c) whether ork chmods a role report that a vendor CLI wrote, or leaves the vendor's mode.
